OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI pays damages to relatives of
OL,4,Amurdered UVF victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) has paid undisclosed damages in
OL,8,Fconnection with loyalist shootings in
OL,9,FCounty Tyrone which left four Catholics
OL,10,Fdead.
OL,12,FRelatives of Charles and Teresa Fox and
OL,13,FKevin McKearney sued the police over
OL,14,Fthe alleged involvement of state
OL,15,Fagents.
OL,17,FAlong with John McKearney, they were
OL,18,Fmurdered by the Ulster Volunteer Force
OL,19,F(UVF) in two separate attacks carried
OL,20,Fout in Moy in 1992.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
