OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI pays damages to relatives of
OL,4,Amurdered UVF victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FKevin McKearney's widow, Bernie, said
OL,7,Fthe settlement is "nice", but added:
OL,8,F"Nobody is ever going to be held
OL,9,Faccountable.
